    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Web</strong> is a <i>First person Pure walking simulator,</i> an experimental art game. You explore an interconnected web of environments.  Each environment is unique, and every path you take is unique, although sometimes the branching paths intertwine. Discover strange places and meet odd characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the universe. The beauty and the horror.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is pure exploration. You walk, look around and jump. It is a <strong>pure</strong> walking simulator. Each scene is very short, you always discover something new. Every environment has original assets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story</strong> of the game is the path you take. You are born into a strange universe, and you choose where to go. There might be stories in the places you discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Web changes, grows and evolves with time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New environments will be added frequently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everything is subject to change</i>, anything can be completely different or entirely gone with each update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There is no AI used in this game</i>, not even for reference</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Buy it once, and every update is free forever.</i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release date to be announced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Similar gameplay:</i></strong><i> LSD: Dream Emulator, KID A MNESIA</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Web</strong> is a <i>First person Pure walking simulator,</i> an experimental art game. You explore an interconnected web of environments.  Each environment is unique, and every path you take is unique, although sometimes the branching paths intertwine. Discover strange places and meet odd characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the universe. The beauty and the horror.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is pure exploration. You walk, look around and jump. It is a <strong>pure</strong> walking simulator. Each scene is very short, you always discover something new. Every environment has original assets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story</strong> of the game is the path you take. You are born into a strange universe, and you choose where to go. There might be stories in the places you discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Web changes, grows and evolves with time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New environments will be added frequently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Everything is subject to change</i>, anything can be completely different or entirely gone with each update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There is no AI used in this game</i>, not even for reference</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Buy it once, and every update is free forever.</i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Release date to be announced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Similar gameplay:</i></strong><i> LSD: Dream Emulator, KID A MNESIA</i></p>",
